    "title": "City of Lake Charles changes Mardi Gras parade schedule due to safety concerns - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KPLC Digital Team Caleb Carter ,\n9 hours ago LAKE CHARLES, La. (KPLC) - Lake Charles Mardi Gras parades will now take place earlier in the day due to safety concerns. The changes follow violence along the parade route this past Mardi Gras that saw two shootings. Officials said at the time there was a marked difference once the sun went down. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
